UID: NEED-2
TITLE: Session timeout
STATEMENT: Idle sessions must expire after 15 minutes.
PRIORITY: Should
RATIONALE: Reduces risk of unauthorized access on shared devices.
STATUS: Proposed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-002
TITLE: REQ-002
STATEMENT: The system shall expire idle sessions after 15 minutes of inactivity.
STATUS: Approved
